#: data/event_scripts.s:1437
msgctxt "gText_MomExplainHPGetPotions"
msgid ""
"MOM: Oh, good! You and your\n"
"POKéMON are looking great.\p"
"I just heard from {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"He said that POKéMON's energy is\n"
"measured in HP.\p"
"If your POKéMON lose their HP,\n"
"you can restore them at any\l"
"POKéMON CENTER.\p"
"If you're going to travel far away,\n"
"the smart TRAINER stocks up on\l"
"POTIONS at the POKéMON MART.\p"
"Make me proud, honey!\p"
"Take care!$"
msgstr ""

